  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-reserva-1-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=2x^3-6x+4\\). Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y su recta tangente en el punto de abscisa correspondiente al máximo relativo de la función.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>: \\(f'(x)=6x^2-6=0\\iff\\boxed{x=\\pm1}\\).</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>−1</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−2) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Máximo relativo en \\(x=-1\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, con \\(f(-1)=-2+6+4=8\\). La tangente ahí es horizontal: \\(y=8\\).</p>\\[2x^3-6x+4=8\\iff x^3-3x-2=0\\iff(x+1)^2(x-2)=0\\iff x=-1\\ \\text{(doble)},\\ x=2\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='92.8,76.7 96.7,76.7 100.6,76.7 104.5,76.7 108.4,76.7 112.3,76.7 116.2,76.7 120.1,76.7 124.0,76.7 127.9,76.7 131.8,76.7 135.7,76.7 139.6,76.7 143.5,76.7 147.4,76.7 151.3,76.7 155.2,76.7 159.1,76.7 163.0,76.7 166.9,76.7 170.8,76.7 174.7,76.7 178.6,76.7 182.5,76.7 186.4,76.7 190.3,76.7 194.2,76.7 198.1,76.7 202.0,76.7 205.9,76.7 209.8,76.7 213.7,76.7 217.6,76.7 221.5,76.7 225.4,76.7 229.3,76.7 233.2,76.7 237.1,76.7 241.0,76.7 244.9,76.7 248.8,76.7 248.8,76.7 244.9,91.2 241.0,104.3 237.1,115.9 233.2,126.2 229.3,135.2 225.4,143.0 221.5,149.6 217.6,155.0 213.7,159.4 209.8,162.7 205.9,165.1 202.0,166.6 198.1,167.3 194.2,167.2 190.3,166.3 186.4,164.8 182.5,162.7 178.6,160.0 174.7,156.8 170.8,153.2 166.9,149.2 163.0,144.8 159.1,140.2 155.2,135.4 151.3,130.5 147.4,125.4 143.5,120.3 139.6,115.2 135.7,110.2 131.8,105.4 127.9,100.7 124.0,96.3 120.1,92.1 116.2,88.4 112.3,85.0 108.4,82.2 104.5,79.9 100.6,78.1 96.7,77.0 92.8,76.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='30.4,213.8 33.3,199.7 36.2,186.5 39.1,174.2 42.0,162.8 44.9,152.2 47.8,142.4 50.6,133.4 53.5,125.2 56.4,117.7 59.3,110.9 62.2,104.8 65.1,99.4 68.0,94.6 70.9,90.4 73.8,86.9 76.7,83.9 79.6,81.4 82.5,79.5 85.4,78.1 88.2,77.2 91.1,76.7 94.0,76.7 96.9,77.1 99.8,77.9 102.7,79.0 105.6,80.5 108.5,82.2 111.4,84.3 114.3,86.7 117.2,89.3 120.1,92.1 123.0,95.1 125.9,98.3 128.7,101.7 131.6,105.2 134.5,108.7 137.4,112.4 140.3,116.1 143.2,119.9 146.1,123.7 149.0,127.5 151.9,131.2 154.8,134.9 157.7,138.5 160.6,142.0 163.5,145.3 166.3,148.6 169.2,151.6 172.1,154.5 175.0,157.1 177.9,159.5 180.8,161.6 183.7,163.4 186.6,164.9 189.5,166.1 192.4,166.9 195.3,167.3 198.2,167.3 201.1,166.9 203.9,166.0 206.8,164.6 209.7,162.8 212.6,160.4 215.5,157.5 218.4,154.0 221.3,149.9 224.2,145.1 227.1,139.8 230.0,133.8 232.9,127.0 235.8,119.6 238.7,111.4 241.6,102.5 244.4,92.8 247.3,82.3 250.2,71.0 253.1,58.8 256.0,45.7 258.9,31.7 261.8,16.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,76.7 150.0,76.7 280.0,76.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='92.8' cy='76.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='72.8' y='68.7'>(−1,8)</text><circle cx='248.8' cy='76.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='254.8' y='70.7'>(2,8)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 167.3H294.0M144.8 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='40.8' y1='164.3' x2='40.8' y2='170.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.8' y='181.3' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='92.8' y1='164.3' x2='92.8' y2='170.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='89.8' y='181.3' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='196.8' y1='164.3' x2='196.8' y2='170.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='193.8' y='181.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='248.8' y1='164.3' x2='248.8' y2='170.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='245.8' y='181.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='141.8' y1='122.0' x2='147.8' y2='122.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='128.8' y='126.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='141.8' y1='76.7' x2='147.8' y2='76.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='128.8' y='80.7' font-size='10'>8</text><line x1='141.8' y1='31.3' x2='147.8' y2='31.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='128.8' y='35.3' font-size='10'>12</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_{-1}^2\\bigl(8-2x^3+6x-4\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[4x+3x^2-\\frac{x^4}2\\Bigr]_{-1}^2=12-\\left(-\\frac32\\right)=\\frac{27}2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}2\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
