  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-reserva-1-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "De entre todos los rectángulos que tienen uno de sus vértices en el origen de coordenadas, el opuesto de este vértice en la curva \\(y=\\dfrac{2x^2}{x^2-1}\\) (\\(x\\gt1\\)), uno de sus lados situado sobre el semieje positivo de abscisas y otro lado sobre el semieje positivo de ordenadas, halla el que tiene área mínima.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El vértice opuesto al origen es \\(\\left(x,\\frac{2x^2}{x^2-1}\\right)\\), con \\(x\\gt1\\). El área es</p>\\[A(x)=x\\cdot\\frac{2x^2}{x^2-1}=\\frac{2x^3}{x^2-1},\\qquad x\\gt1\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[A'(x)=\\frac{6x^2(x^2-1)-2x^3\\cdot2x}{(x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{2x^2(x^2-3)}{(x^2-1)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=\\sqrt3}\\ (x\\gt1)\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 210 108' width='100%' style='max-width:252px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H196' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>√3</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text><text x='129.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M143.0 40L179.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M170.0 11L179.0 10L177.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='155.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(A\\) decrece en \\((1,\\sqrt3)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((\\sqrt3,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\gt0\\): mínimo absoluto en \\(x=\\sqrt3\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>. La altura es \\(\\frac{2\\cdot3}{3-1}=3\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='105.5,-7.4 107.7,16.5 109.9,33.2 112.1,45.7 114.2,55.2 116.4,62.8 118.6,68.9 120.8,74.0 123.0,78.2 125.1,81.8 127.3,84.9 129.5,87.6 131.7,90.0 133.9,92.1 136.0,93.9 138.2,95.6 140.4,97.1 142.6,98.4 144.8,99.7 147.0,100.8 149.1,101.8 151.3,102.7 153.5,103.6 155.7,104.4 157.9,105.1 160.0,105.8 162.2,106.4 164.4,107.0 166.6,107.5 168.8,108.0 170.9,108.5 173.1,108.9 175.3,109.4 177.5,109.8 179.7,110.1 181.9,110.5 184.0,110.8 186.2,111.1 188.4,111.4 190.6,111.7 192.8,112.0 194.9,112.2 197.1,112.5 199.3,112.7 201.5,112.9 203.7,113.1 205.8,113.3 208.0,113.5 210.2,113.7 212.4,113.9 214.6,114.1 216.7,114.2 218.9,114.4 221.1,114.5 223.3,114.7 225.5,114.8 227.7,114.9 229.8,115.0 232.0,115.2 234.2,115.3 236.4,115.4 238.6,115.5 240.7,115.6 242.9,115.7 245.1,115.8 247.3,115.9 249.5,116.0 251.6,116.1 253.8,116.2 256.0,116.2 258.2,116.3 260.4,116.4 262.6,116.5 264.7,116.5 266.9,116.6 269.1,116.7 271.3,116.8 273.5,116.8 275.6,116.9 277.8,116.9 280.0,117.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='137.4' y1='170.0' x2='137.4' y2='95.0' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='37.3' y1='95.0' x2='137.4' y2='95.0' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='137.4' cy='95.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='143.4' y='89.0'>(√3, 3)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 170.0H294.0M37.3 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='95.1' y1='167.0' x2='95.1' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='92.1' y='184.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='152.9' y1='167.0' x2='152.9' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='149.9' y='184.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='210.7' y1='167.0' x2='210.7' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.7' y='184.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='268.4' y1='167.0' x2='268.4' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='265.4' y='184.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='34.3' y1='120.0' x2='40.3' y2='120.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='124.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='34.3' y1='70.0' x2='40.3' y2='70.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='74.0' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><div class='res'>El rectángulo de base \\(\\sqrt3\\) y altura \\(3\\) (vértice \\((\\sqrt3,3)\\)), con área mínima \\(3\\sqrt3\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
