1.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='103.7' y='182.2' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='193.3' y1='165.2' x2='193.3' y2='171.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='190.3' y='182.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='236.7' y1='165.2' x2='236.7' y2='171.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='233.7' y='182.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='124.6' x2='153.0' y2='124.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='128.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='81.0' x2='153.0' y2='81.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='85.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='37.4' x2='153.0' y2='37.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='41.4' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por la simetría, calculo la mitad derecha y multiplico por 2:</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^2(6-x^2-x)\\,dx=2\\Bigl[6x-\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac{x^2}2\\Bigr]_0^2=2\\left(12-\\frac83-2\\right)=\\frac{44}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{44}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2003-RESERVA-1.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
