  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-reserva-1-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Una empresa cinematográfica dispone de tres salas, A, B y C. Los precios de entrada a estas salas son de 3, 4 y 5 euros, respectivamente. Un día la recaudación conjunta de las tres salas fue de 720 euros y el número total de espectadores fue de 200. Si los espectadores de la sala A hubieran asistido a la sala B y los de la sala B a la sala A, se hubiese obtenido una recaudación de 20 euros más. Calcula el número de espectadores que acudió a cada una de las salas.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Sean \\(a\\), \\(b\\), \\(c\\) los espectadores de las salas A, B y C:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}a+b+c=200\\\\3a+4b+5c=720\\\\3b+4a+5c=740\\end{cases}\\]<p>3.ª − 2.ª: \\(a-b=20\\). 2.ª − 5·(1.ª): \\(-2a-b=-280\\iff2a+b=280\\). Con \\(a=b+20\\): \\(3b+40=280\\iff b=80\\), \\(a=100\\), \\(c=20\\).</p><div class='res'>Sala A: 100 espectadores; sala B: 80; sala C: 20</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(300+320+100=720\\) y \\(400+240+100=740\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "plan",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2003-RESERVA-1.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2003-reserva-1-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla la ecuación de una circunferencia que pase por el punto \\((-1,-8)\\) y sea tangente a los ejes coordenados.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Si es tangente a los dos ejes, su centro está a la misma distancia \\(r\\) de ambos, y como \\((-1,-8)\\) está en el tercer cuadrante, el centro es \\((-r,-r)\\) con radio \\(r\\):</p>\\[(x+r)^2+(y+r)^2=r^2\\]<p>Pasa por \\((-1,-8)\\):</p>\\[(r-1)^2+(r-8)^2=r^2\\iff r^2-18r+65=0\\iff r=5\\ \\text{ o }\\ r=13\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 260 260' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,41.3 130.0,41.3 240.0,41.3' fill='none' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='218.7' y1='240.0' x2='218.7' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><polyline points='147.7,76.8 148.3,70.3 148.9,67.7 149.5,65.7 150.1,64.0 150.7,62.6 151.3,61.3 151.9,60.1 152.5,59.1 153.1,58.1 153.7,57.2 154.2,56.3 154.8,55.5 155.4,54.7 156.0,54.0 156.6,53.3 157.2,52.6 157.8,52.0 158.4,51.4 159.0,50.9 159.6,50.3 160.2,49.8 160.8,49.3 161.3,48.8 161.9,48.4 162.5,48.0 163.1,47.5 163.7,47.1 164.3,46.8 164.9,46.4 165.5,46.0 166.1,45.7 166.7,45.4 167.3,45.1 167.8,44.8 168.4,44.5 169.0,44.3 169.6,44.0 170.2,43.8 170.8,43.5 171.4,43.3 172.0,43.1 172.6,42.9 173.2,42.7 173.8,42.6 174.4,42.4 174.9,42.3 175.5,42.1 176.1,42.0 176.7,41.9 177.3,41.8 177.9,41.7 178.5,41.6 179.1,41.5 179.7,41.5 180.3,41.4 180.9,41.4 181.5,41.3 182.0,41.3 182.6,41.3 183.2,41.3 183.8,41.3 184.4,41.3 185.0,41.3 185.6,41.4 186.2,41.4 186.8,41.5 187.4,41.5 188.0,41.6 188.5,41.7 189.1,41.8 189.7,41.9 190.3,42.0 190.9,42.1 191.5,42.3 192.1,42.4 192.7,42.6 193.3,42.7 193.9,42.9 194.5,43.1 195.1,43.3 195.6,43.5 196.2,43.8 196.8,44.0 197.4,44.3 198.0,44.5 198.6,44.8 199.2,45.1 199.8,45.4 200.4,45.7 201.0,46.0 201.6,46.4 202.2,46.8 202.7,47.1 203.3,47.5 203.9,48.0 204.5,48.4 205.1,48.8 205.7,49.3 206.3,49.8 206.9,50.3 207.5,50.9 208.1,51.4 208.7,52.0 209.2,52.6 209.8,53.3 210.4,54.0 211.0,54.7 211.6,55.5 212.2,56.3 212.8,57.2 213.4,58.1 214.0,59.1 214.6,60.1 215.2,61.3 21